---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const EMAIL = "contact@whatifbench.com";
const UPDATED = "2 September 2026";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What data whatifbench collects, how advertising cookies are used, and the choices available to you."
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-date">Last updated: {UPDATED}</p>

  <p>
    This policy explains what happens to data when you visit whatifbench.com.
    The short version: the site has no accounts, no newsletter, and no login,
    and the calculators run entirely in your browser.
  </p>

  <h2>What the calculators do with your input</h2>

  <p>
    Values you type or drag into a calculator are processed by JavaScript
    running on your own device. They are never transmitted to a server, stored,
    or logged. Closing the page discards them.
  </p>

  <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>

  <p>
    This site is served through Cloudflare, which processes technical data
    needed to deliver pages and to protect the site from abuse. This includes
    your IP address, browser and device type, the pages requested, and the time
    of the request. Cloudflare may set a cookie to distinguish legitimate
    visitors from automated traffic. This data is used for security and
    reliability, not to build a profile of you.
  </p>

  <h2>Fonts</h2>

  <p>
    Pages load their typefaces from Google Fonts. That request goes to Google's
    servers and carries your IP address and browser details, in the same way any
    request for a file does. Google states that it does not use Google Fonts
    requests to build advertising profiles. No cookie is set by this.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>

  <p>
    This site does not currently show advertising. It is intended to carry
    advertising supplied by Google, including Google AdSense, and this section
    describes what happens when it does. Third-party vendors, including Google,
    use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other
    websites.
  </p>

  <p>
    Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads
    to you based on your visit to this site and other sites on the internet. You
    can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting
    <a
      href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads"
      rel="nofollow noopener"
      target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a
    >. You can also opt out of third-party vendor cookies for personalised
    advertising at
    <a
      href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/"
      rel="nofollow noopener"
      target="_blank">aboutads.info</a
    >.
  </p>

  <p>
    Third-party advertising vendors operate under their own privacy policies.
    Google's is available at
    <a
      href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites"
      rel="nofollow noopener"
      target="_blank">policies.google.com</a
    >.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>

  <p>
    Cookies are small files stored by your browser. This site uses them only for
    the security and advertising purposes described above. Every current browser
    lets you block or delete cookies through its settings. Blocking them will
    not affect the calculators, which do not depend on cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>If you are in the European Economic Area or the United Kingdom</h2>

  <p>
    Where the GDPR applies, the legal basis for processing technical data is
    legitimate interest in operating and securing the site. The legal basis for
    personalised advertising is your consent. Since the site does not yet show
    advertising, no consent notice is displayed; one will be shown, and will be
    changeable at any time, before any advertising cookie is set.
  </p>

  <p>
    You have the right to request access to your personal data, correction or
    deletion of it, restriction of processing, and to object to processing. To
    exercise any of these, email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>If you are in California</h2>

  <p>
    Under the CCPA you have the right to know what personal information is
    collected, to request its deletion, and to opt out of its sale or sharing.
    This site does not sell personal information. To make a request, use the
    email address above.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>

  <p>
    This site is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly
    collect their personal information. If you believe a child has provided such
    information, contact me and it will be removed.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>

  <p>
    Pages here may link to other sites. Those sites have their own policies and
    are outside my control.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>

  <p>
    This policy may be updated. The date at the top reflects the most recent
    revision. Material changes will be noted on this page.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>

  <p>
    Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
